  "document": "Papa Murphy's Park\nPapa Murphy's Park (formerly known as the Cal Expo Multi-Use Sports Field Facility and Bonney Field) is a sports venue located on the grounds of Cal Expo in Sacramento, California. The soccer-specific stadium has a capacity of 11,569 and includes a full-sized (120 x 80 yard) soccer field. Papa Murphy's Park is the current home of Sacramento Republic FC soccer team and former home of PRO Rugby team, Sacramento Express."
